# Character quirks (VanGuard build).

quirk-category-name = Character quirks

quirk-fleet-footed-name = Light gait
quirk-fleet-footed-desc = You move a little faster than most people of your species.

quirk-sturdy-nerves-name = Steady endurance
quirk-sturdy-nerves-desc = Tiring work drains you noticeably slower than most people.

quirk-cold-hardened-name = Cold-seasoned
quirk-cold-hardened-desc = Long shifts in cold rooms taught you to shrug off low temperatures.

quirk-clear-head-name = Clear head
quirk-clear-head-desc = Alcohol affects you noticeably less than most people around you.

quirk-quick-clot-name = Quick-clotting blood
quirk-quick-clot-desc = Your wounds stop bleeding faster than usual.

quirk-rad-hardened-name = Radiation-hardened
quirk-rad-hardened-desc = Your body tolerates radiation better than most.

quirk-heavy-gait-name = Heavy gait
quirk-heavy-gait-desc = You move a little slower than most people of your species.

quirk-weak-nerves-name = Weak endurance
quirk-weak-nerves-desc = Tiring work drains you faster than most people.

quirk-fragile-name = Fragile build
quirk-fragile-desc = Blunt blows and cuts hurt you more than they should.

quirk-frostbite-name = Frost-prone
quirk-frostbite-desc = Low temperatures bite into you harder than into most people.

quirk-thin-blood-name = Poor clotting
quirk-thin-blood-desc = Your wounds keep bleeding longer than usual.

quirk-rad-sensitive-name = Radiation-sensitive
quirk-rad-sensitive-desc = Radiation harms you more than most people.

